### ================================================
### PERSONA NATURAL SIN NEGOCIO (RUC 10 / DNI)
### ================================================

### POST - Crear Persona Natural Sin Negocio
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/personas
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer 

{
    "tipoPersonaCode": "NATURAL_SIN_NEGOCIO",
    "tipoDocumentoCode": "DNI",
    "numeroDocumento": "72189034",
    "numeroCelular": "(+51) 987654001",
    "correo": "natural1@test.com",
    "nombres": "Juan Carlos",
    "apellidos": "Perez Rodriguez",
    "generoCode": "MASCULINO",
    "estadoCivilCode": "SOLTERO",
    "fechaNacimiento": "1990-05-15"
}

### GET - Buscar Personas Naturales Sin Negocio
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/personas?q=Juan&tipoPersonaCode=NATURAL_SIN_NEGOCIO
Content-Type: application/json

### PUT - Actualizar Persona Natural Sin Negocio
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/personas/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer

{
    "tipoPersonaCode": "NATURAL_SIN_NEGOCIO",
    "tipoDocumentoCode": "DNI",
    "numeroDocumento": "72189034",
    "numeroCelular": "(+51) 987654001",
    "correo": "actualizado@test.com",
    "nombres": "Juan Actualizado",
    "apellidos": "Perez Rodriguez",
    "generoCode": "MASCULINO",
    "estadoCivilCode": "SOLTERO",
    "fechaNacimiento": "1990-05-15"
}

